🎮 Project Stormfall — Battle Royale

Project Stormfall is a multiplayer-style battle royale game where you choose an operative, select a game mode, drop onto a large map, collect loot, survive the shrinking zone, and be the last player standing.

Characters:

👻 Ghost — temporary invisibility
⚡ Surge — speed boost
🛡️ Fortress — extra armor/shield
🐍 Viper — poison cloud
🦅 Hawk — area scan
💚 Medic — healing burst

Modes: Solo, Duo, and Squad.

Gameplay includes:

Large procedurally generated map with locations such as Stormfall City, Airport, Military Base, Research Lab, and Beach Resort.
Lootable weapons, ammunition, health, armor, and grenades.
Multiple weapon types with different ranges and firing characteristics.
Shrinking safe zone that forces players toward the center.
Bot opponents with basic combat, movement, and looting AI.
Supply drops and special character abilities.
Minimap, health/armor HUD, kill feed, weapon inventory, ability cooldowns, and mobile controls.
Final results showing placement, eliminations, damage, and survival time.

Controls: WASD to move, mouse to aim/shoot, E to interact, R to reload, 1–5 to switch weapons, Q for ability, Space to dash, and G for grenades.
